            "text": "{\"title\":\"Weeknight Tuscan Garlic and Rosemary Pork Roast\",\"readyInMinutes\":35,\"servings\":4,\"summary\":\"This \u003cb\u003eweeknight Italian pork roast\u003c/b\u003e offers a fast and elegant solution for busy evenings without sacrificing traditional Mediterranean flavor. Tender pork tenderloin is seasoned with aromatic rosemary, garlic, and wild oregano before being seared to perfection in a skillet and finished rapidly in a high-temperature oven. A splash of dry white wine and fresh lemon juice pan-deglazes the rich roasted drippings to create a glossy, silky sauce right in the pan. Perfectly balanced and fragrant, this meal brings the rustic charm of a Tuscan Sunday dinner directly to your mid-week table in under forty minutes. Pair this roast with a crisp green salad, warm crusty ciabatta bread, or roasted baby potatoes to complete a wholesome Italian dining experience. Rich in \u003cb\u003elean protein\u003c/b\u003e, essential minerals, and vibrant herbs, this dish delivers sophisticated comfort food with minimal preparation effort and effortless cleanup. It is guaranteed to become a reliable staple for quick family dinners and casual entertaining alike.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":320,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":16},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":14,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":18},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":4.5,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":23},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":3,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":1},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":0.5,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":1},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":42,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":84},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":115,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":38},{\"name\":\"Sodium\",\"amount\":480,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":21},{\"name\":\"Fiber\",\"amount\":0.8,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":3},{\"name\":\"Vitamin A\",\"amount\"